@{
    Layout = null;
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>bir şeyler ters gitti / 500</title>
    <style>
            :root {
                --bg: #f9f9f9;
                --text: #1a1a1a;
                --muted: #737373;
                --accent: #e05a47;
                --border: #e5e5e5;
                --font-serif: "Georgia", serif;
                --font-mono: "Courier New", Courier, monospace;
            }

            body {
                background-color: var(--bg);
                color: var(--text);
                font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                margin: 0;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                min-height: 100vh;
                padding: 2rem;
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            .error-container {
                max-width: 500px;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .error-code {
                font-family: var(--font-mono);
                font-size: 14px;
                color: var(--accent);
                text-transform: uppercase;
                letter-spacing: 2px;
                margin-bottom: 1rem;
            }

            h1 {
                font-family: var(--font-serif);
                font-size: 32px;
                font-weight: 600;
                margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
                line-height: 1.2;
            }

            p {
                color: var(--muted);
                font-size: 15px;
                line-height: 1.6;
                margin: 0 0 2.5rem 0;
            }

            .back-btn {
                display: inline-block;
                background: var(--text);
                color: var(--bg);
                text-decoration: none;
                padding: 12px 28px;
                font-size: 13px;
                font-family: var(--font-mono);
                border-radius: 6px;
                transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
            }

                .back-btn:hover {
                    opacity: 0.9;
                }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="error-container">
        <div class="error-code">hata kodu: 500 / sunucu hatası</div>
        <h1>bir şeyler ters gitti.</h1>
        <p>şu anda isteğinizi gerçekleştiremiyoruz. teknik ekibimiz durumdan haberdar edildi ve arka planda loglar inceleniyor.</p>
        <a href="/Dashboard" class="back-btn">kumanda merkezine dön</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>